{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "053e497f-4ec5-842a-ac67-cadb4dc09369",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T14:31:07-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dulce Spencer",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:28:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:28:50-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Hi. Sorry, I'm going to whisper. Somebody's sleeping in the next room. Can you hear me okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:28:57-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can hear you, a little faint. Go ahead, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. My name is Dulce Spencer. I'm calling about my trash. The truck came this morning and, um, they broke my bin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:10-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. The bin was broken by the truck, you said. What part of it, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The lid is cracked clean off. And one side is caved in. It was by the curb, where it always is. [line breaks up] ...not in the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, you broke up on me a second. You said it was at the curb, not in the road. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. At the curb. Same as always."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And is this the first time something like this has happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, it's the second miss in a row. Last week they skipped me altogether. Left the bin full. And now this, they took it and wrecked it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So last week's pickup was missed, and this week the bin was damaged. Two in a row. I'm writing that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. That's it. [pause] And, um, when I called the first time somebody told me to ask for someone patient. So I'm asking."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:10-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'll do my best. I'm not going anywhere. Let me get a few details. Can I have the address where the bin is?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:19-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. I'd rather not say it on the phone, with the speaker on. Can you work with a callback number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take a number for now. Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0176."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:32-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-seven-six. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:38-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll put in a report for the damaged bin and note the missed pickup from last week. Someone will call you back to confirm the address and arrange a replacement. Does the afternoon work better, or the morning?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:52-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon is better. Mornings he's sleeping late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:30:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Afternoon it is. Anything else I can do for you today, Ms. Spencer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's all. Thank you for being patient."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T14:31:04-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care now."
    }
  ],
